# Instagram Profile Artwork

Status: DONE
Milestone: M9 Deliver square, circular-frame and portrait brand images
Dependencies: 12_WHISK_AND_CRUMBS_BRAND.todo

## Purpose

Create a recognisable profile image for the existing Instagram account, with a
matching edge-touching circular-frame copy and a 3:4 variant without that frame.
Use the singular Whisk & Crumbs identity and preserve the original palette/mark.

## Tasks

- [x] Research current Instagram profile-image shape and sizing guidance online.
- [x] Distinguish third-party advice from unverified official upload restrictions.
- [x] Create a 1080x1080 square master with the approved whisk and large lettering.
- [x] Create a matching square with a centred 540px-radius circle touching all edges.
- [x] Create a 1080x1440 portrait without the circular frame or stretched artwork.
- [x] Inspect a three-variant preview and small circular crops.
- [x] Verify geometry, safe artwork bounds, file hashes and native output dimensions.
- [x] Record the final delivery paths without changing the Instagram account or website.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Exactly three main PNG files have the requested dimensions and ratios.
- [x] Essential square artwork is within radius 440px of the canvas centre, leaving
  at least 100px clearance inside Instagram's centred 540px-radius crop.
- [x] The framed circle is centred at (540, 540) and meets all four square edges.
- [x] Portrait artwork is reflowed, not stretched, and has no outer circular frame.
- [x] Tiny avatar previews are inspected separately from full-resolution artwork.
- [x] No claim is made that an image was uploaded or accepted by Instagram.

## Completion evidence

- Generator: ..\scripts\generate_instagram_assets.py.
- Deliverables: ..\assets\social\instagram\.
- Geometry/source/hash record: ..\assets\social\instagram\manifest.json.
- Review images: ..\.local\instagram-profile-review\.
- Targeted tests: ..\tests\test_instagram_assets.py.
- Four targeted cases pass. All three PNGs reproduce byte-for-byte on a second
  generation run; RGB outputs carry no EXIF/XMP.
- Measured essential-artwork radius: 434.28px, leaving 105.72px inside the crop.
  Four tangent pixels match the outer green circle; inner artwork is identical
  between square/framed files. Portrait art matches the translated square pixels.
- Sources checked 2026-10-04:
  https://blog.hootsuite.com/social-media-image-sizes-guide/
  https://sproutsocial.com/insights/social-media-image-sizes-guide/
- Hootsuite describes square inputs displayed as circles and recommends at least
  320px; Sprout recommends 1:1 and recognisable small-size branding. Their exact
  pixel figures differ and are not treated as official Instagram restrictions.

